\newlabel{fig:fix}{{4}{10}{Effect of the anchor-robust wrapper, which was given no information about which loss is decoupled. (a) The prior weight is bounded at one for both gradient-norm balancers. (b) The parameter error of LL-EMA falls from $52.9\%$ to $0.030\%$; LRA's apparent accuracy without the wrapper is the circular result discussed in the text, not a successful inference}{figure.4}{}}
